  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ma&apos;an, The Jordan Valley Resiliency Program 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extends MFA support to Jordan Valley through a new phase that combines suppoorting community resilience with women empowerment. The project supports the Palestinian Communities&apos; resilience in Jordan Valley, an area of geopolitical complexity and economic hardship. This project includes two primary outcomes; 1- Strengthening the physical and professional capacities of the essential services addressing mainly children, especially schools and health clinics. The project also aims at supporting the local communities with interventions to support children&apos;s resilience through extracurricular activities. 2- Provide selected women with financial and technical support to initiate and establish small businesses.</narrative>
  </description>
